This repository contains deployment subsets of:
- Perplexity autojev, perplexity-ai/pplx-decider-v1.1-27b,
  revision 3b45dead91dfa6d95aad6b95764a606fab2bf7a6 (Apache-2.0).
- AgentJev, malevrigns/agent-jev (Apache-2.0), via the locally
  adapted text_jev_train baseline commit 183153817b683b941123f7c708be286c9ecae279.

The autojev model.py includes the local processor chat-template fallback used
in training. Model scoring and checkpoint loading are preserved.
In this deployment subset, autojev GET / redirects to /docs, and AgentJev
GET / returns model info when no custom page is supplied, because the source
snapshots contain no playground HTML. No training weights or data are included.
The base model and dataset licenses apply separately to their artifacts.
